== whatnerd==
P : what do you think happened ?
N : what do I think happened ? hm ..
he strokes the stubble on his chin as if it were a beard , looking down at the ground in contemplation . 
N : I do not have enough information on hand to draw any conclusions at this time , however I do think it was not a mere accident . 
finally , someone who gets it ! 
N : wipe that smug grin off your face , it does not suit you . 
you keep forgetting how much of a prick he is . 
N : there are too many factors in play that cannot simply be explained away by calling it an accident . What the solution may be is uncertain for now . 
P : can you at least try to guess at what may be the cause of her death ? 
Evan’s thin lips spread into a snarky grin . 
N : aliens . 
P : you’re the worst …
you could recognise well enough that Evan wasn’t going to entertain you for any longer , and you decide to cut your losses .
-> END 

==whonerd==
P: Who do you think did it?
N: did it? that’s preposterous, really I don’t think anyone in our group had some.. deep-seeded hatred for Bridget.
N: Not enough to kill her, anyways..
N: Though if it was murder.. well then it was probably Hayleigh and Bryce, no? they were the ones closest to her, and they heard nothing? 
P: I mean, that is pretty strange .
Evan pushes up his glasses with his middle finger before continuing . 
N: But, what’d be their motivation? Why kill a random friend you were close to in highschool? Bryce lives in California now and Hayleigh has her studies to worry about, they don’t seem like the type to throw away their life now to murder Bridget of all people.. 
P: I mean there could be more to it that  we don’t know about..
Evan gives you a look, the same one he’d give you when you’d forget to apply PEMDAS on your maths homework . Or if you mentioned your unironic enjoyment of the MCU , something he considered ‘ low class media ‘ . 
N : pray tell , what bombshell of information are we missing that could possibly explain a murder motive ? 
P : uh ...
N : I thought so …
you could recognise well enough that Evan wasn’t going to entertain you for any longer , and you decide to cut your losses .
-> END
